    content: {
      text: "The concept of opportunity cost is fundamental to understanding economic decision-making. When resources are scarce, choosing one option means forgoing another. This principle applies to individuals, businesses, and governments alike. Recognizing opportunity costs helps people make more informed choices about how to allocate their time, money, and attention."
    }
